## 🛠️ DEVELOPMENT

### Adding a New Agent

1. Create a new directory: `mkdir myagent`
2. Create `myagent/cartridge_main.py` with your agent logic
3. Run `python civic/tools/registry_tool.py .` to register
4. Your agent appears in `AGENTS.md` automatically

